 6579:   /// (Re)arms the blink timer with the caret forced visible. Called when the
 6580:   /// caret first becomes visible, and again on every selection change while it
 6581:   /// stays visible, so the caret snaps back to its visible phase instead of
 6582:   /// possibly lingering in the hidden half-cycle.
 6583:   void _startBlinkTimer() {
 6584:     _blinkActive = true;
 6585:     _blinkValue = 1.0;
